    physicsList: ['Dynamic strikes and powerful launches', 'Varied enemies and arena hazards', 'Bosses, story, and mixed challenges'],
    physicsImageAlt: 'A fighter launches an enemy with a blue energy attack',
    galleryIndex: '03 / INTO THE ARENA',
